          "abridged": false,
          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "Get ready to move, groove, and light up the room with high-energy dance beats for kids.\n\nWhether it's a kitchen disco or a full living room takeover, this album is built for pure, joyful movement from the very first beat. \"Disco Feet\" and \"Dancing in the Stars\" are instant crowd-pleasers, and \"After School Boogie\" is the perfect antidote to a long school day. Every track comes loaded with the kind of hook that gets into your feet before your brain even notices.\n\nThese songs were designed for little ears and little feet but with the same tools, talent and level of detail that goes into crafting any major dance hit. The team used studios, session players and singers from around the UK to create the perfect sonic mix. No experience required, just turn it up and dance.\n",
